      "excerpt": "Twenty-one operations from Consequences to Checkmate are listed in the campaign encyclopedia.",
      "body": "The Central Qiyah War is the first fully indexed conflict in the encyclopedia — 21 missions from the 2019 desert grid strikes through the 2022 Enzelafanzi push.\n\nHighlights include Deathless over the canal mouth, Air Raid ballistic intercepts, and Checkmate as the endgame package. Hangar selection and playable status follow the main game build — the wiki lists what's canon either way.",
