      "excerpt": "S-21 strike package, fleeing carrier group, and why Valorterra won't confirm the tally.",
      "body": "March 11th 2020: allied S-21 Deathless strike elements hit a fleeing carrier group screened by destroyers during Central Qiyah spillover ops. Valorterra registry lists the platform; the after-action tally is… disputed.\n\nEscort packages included F-16SM3s, Cy-30, J/A-11, and mass J/I-8B sorties. Opposition called in Cy-47, Cy-30, K-1, Shachi, and UH-1 assets. If you were there, you don't talk about it. If you weren't, you talk anyway.",
